---
description: >-
  Forward-position central connection (circle at destination only) applied
  to the reverse half-arrow family (`/|-`, `\|-`, `//-`, `\\-` and their
  dotted forms), with Bob as sender labeled LTR -- the reverse-arrow
  counterpart of "-with-normal-arrows-left-to-right", part of a matched
  LTR/RTL pair.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  participant Charlie
  Bob/|-()Alice: Solid top reverse with circle (LTR)
  Bob\|-()Alice: Solid bottom reverse with circle (LTR)
  Bob//-()Alice: Stick top reverse with circle (LTR)
  Bob\\-()Alice: Stick bottom reverse with circle (LTR)
  Bob/|--()Alice: Dotted solid top reverse with circle (LTR)
  Bob\|--()Alice: Dotted solid bottom reverse with circle (LTR)
  Bob//--()Alice: Dotted stick top reverse with circle (LTR)
  Bob\\--()Alice: Dotted stick bottom reverse with circle (LTR)
